Below is an interactive multi-language implementation of the Rudin-Osher-Fatemi (ROF) Total Variation Denoising algorithm using an explicit gradient descent scheme with artificial time stepping:
\[\frac{\partial u}{\partial t} = \nabla \cdot \left( \frac{\nabla u}{\sqrt{|\nabla u|^2 + \epsilon^2}} \right) - \lambda (u - f)\]

